  "title": "Mother of All Bombs for Iran? US Plans Reported #shorts",
  "description": "CNN reports that the US military has drafted new strike options for Iran that include the GBU-43/B, the so-called \"mother of all bombs\", against energy infrastructure and nuclear sites such as Pickaxe Mountain. According to CNN's sources they would apply only if President Trump orders combat to resume, and several sources doubt the bomb could penetrate deeply buried facilities. Trump told Newsmax the bomb \"is not nuclear\". These are anonymous-source reports; the Pentagon has not published any plan.\n\nSources:\nCNN: US considering using 'Mother of All Bombs' against Iran, sources say (Oct 15, 2026)\nJerusalem Post: 'Mother of all bombs': US potential Iran strike plans include largest non-nuclear weapon (Oct 2026)\nMilitary.com: 'Mother of All Bombs': Iran Energy Sites Could Be Targeted (Oct 2026)\nKurdistan24: US Weighs 'Mother of All Bombs' in Potential New Strikes Against Iran (Oct 2026)\nTimes of Israel liveblog, Oct 15, 2026\n\n#geopolitics #Iran #USA #MOAB",
